    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Look, I'm tired of the canned responses. I need a real answer here for once. Between Candidate Miller and Candidate Ross, who is actually better suited to handle the current inflation crisis? Don't give me the 'on the one hand' speech or the 'it depends' nonsense; just tell me the reality of who has the better plan.",
